    "detailed_description": "Being a good detective requires persistence, discretion, and insight. Having all of those, Detective Scott managed to build a successful career. One day a mysterious client approaches him with a seemingly simple request: go to a remote deserted village and find the client's grandmother. The Detective has no idea of the ancient curse hanging over the village, and the dangers he'll have to face!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nComplete 200 card layouts of varying difficulty, help the Detective crack the case and break the curse plaguing the village!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- A complex story with intriguing characters!<br />\r\n- A unique solitaire game with a mysterious story!<br />\r\n- Mystical village atmosphere!<br />\r\n- Ramp up combos and gain bonuses!<br />\r\n- Many different bonuses and buffs!<br />\r\n- Learn about the curse threatening the village!<br />\r\n- 200 fantastic card layouts!<br />\r\n- Challenge yourself by overcoming various obstacles!",
